"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc60w4mN","user":{"login":"BurningFluffer","id":138900251,"node_id":"U_kgDOCEdzGw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/138900251?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/BurningFluffer","html_url":"https://github.com/BurningFluffer","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BurningFluffer/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BurningFluffer/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BurningFluffer/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BurningFluffer/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BurningFluffer/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BurningFluffer/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BurningFluffer/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BurningFluffer/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BurningFluffer/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-07-03T15:29:43Z","updated_at":"2025-07-03T15:29:43Z","body":"It seems CSS uses a more readable font for \"cursive\" as fallback, just in case. In games though, imagine making a \"hand-written letter by an elegant lord\" and instead it's written in the infamous Comic Sans.\nThat said, I wonder why Droid Sans Mono is both \"monospace\" and \"fantasy\" on android. There aren't just 4 base fonts guaranteed present in all android devices, right? Understandably it would be preferrable if the font supports glyphs for at least most languages.","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3032713613/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3032738349","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/108201#issuecomment-3032738349","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/108201","id":3032738349,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc60w-ot","user":{"login":"Calinou","id":180032,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4MDAzMg==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/180032?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou","html_url":"https://github.com/Calinou","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-07-03T15:38:18Z","updated_at":"2025-07-03T15:40:05Z","body":"This is what I see on https://jsbin.com/cudiwerifi/ on Chromium 138 on Linux:\n\n![Image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/edc8dae0-136a-4fc7-8e6b-4d716df98a0d)\n\nAnd on Firefox 139 (note that I forced `serif` to appear as `sans-serif` in my browser configuration):\n\n![Image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/201a7989-951a-4821-b151-a622abda1975)\n\nIt seems many browser/OS configurations don't have any default fonts for `cursive` and `fantasy` in the first place. It may look different on your end.\n\n<details>\n<summary>HTML source for the JSBin</summary>\n\n```html\n<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html>\n<head>\n  <meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n  <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width\">\n  <title>JS Bin</title>\n</head>\n<body>\n  <p style=\"font-family: serif;\">font-family: serif</p>\n  <p style=\"font-family: sans-serif;\">font-family: sans-serif</p>\n  <p style=\"font-family: monospace;\">font-family: monospace</p>\n  <p style=\"font-family: cursive;\">font-family: cursive</p>\n  <p style=\"font-family: fantasy;\">font-family: fantasy</p>\n</body>\n</html>\n```\n</details>","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3032738349/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3032851749","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/108201#issuecomment-3032851749","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/108201","id":3032851749,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc60xaUl","user":{"login":"bs-mwoerner","id":35597337,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM1NTk3MzM3","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/35597337?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/bs-mwoerner","html_url":"https://github.com/bs-mwoerner","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bs-mwoerner/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bs-mwoerner/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bs-mwoerner/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bs-mwoerner/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bs-mwoerner/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bs-mwoerner/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bs-mwoerner/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bs-mwoerner/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bs-mwoerner/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-07-03T16:20:26Z","updated_at":"2025-07-03T16:20:26Z","body":"> This is what I see on https://jsbin.com/cudiwerifi/ on Chromium 138 on Linux:\n\nFirefox actually gives me Comic Sans for \"cursive\" on Windows 10. 😄\n\n![Image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/3b45f00c-3fbf-4a93-8e76-218ccfd366b3)\n\nEdge agrees with Comic Sans for \"cursive\", but thinks nothing says \"fantasy\" just like Impact.\n\n![Image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/7477fd6f-3fc6-4e66-af62-267a28e88ece)\n","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3032851749/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]